## **Looking Ahead: Session 4**

Session 4 will focus on Removing Classroom Wall Barriers — creating seamless, inclusive learning experiences that transcend physical and timetable limitations. The AI-generated resources you have designed in this session may form a useful starting point for that work.

| **Prepare for Session 4 — Things to Think About** |
| --- |
| Which of your learners face barriers to engagement beyond the classroom (timetable clashes, accessibility needs, remote access)? How might the resources you have created this session be deployed asynchronously? What does ‘blended learning’ mean in your specific subject context? |

